{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51163","headline":"春日代情人 · 董思恭","name":"春日代情人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日管弦调，将人舞细腰。\n悬知今日恨，谁分昔时娇。\n弃妾频登陇，从军几度辽？\n可怜香草夜，空见落花朝。\n泪滴珠难尽，容残玉易销。\n偿随明月去，（「偿」，赵遂之云当作「傥」。\n）莫道梦魂遥。\n（《永乐大典》三○○五人字韵引《玉台後咏》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"董思恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}